{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"leezer3.OpenBVE","latestVersion":"1.14.1.2","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"A license-free, open source, free of charge train driving simulator.","license":"BSD-2-Clause","licenseUrl":"https://openbve-project.net/copyright/","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"A license-free, open source, free of charge train driving simulator.","license":"BSD-2-Clause","licenseUrl":"https://openbve-project.net/copyright/","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"OpenBVE is a license-free, open source, free of charge train driving simulator.\nThis program includes detailed per-car simulation of the brake systems, friction, air resistance, toppling and more. In 3D cabs, the driving experience is augmented with forces that shake your simulated body upon acceleration and braking, as well as in curves. Besides that, OpenBVE features a 3D positional sound system best enjoyed with surround speakers, train exteriors and timetables for the current run. Finally, via the main menu, routes and trains be easily selected to start a new session, the controls can be configured to keyboard or joystick devices, and a variety of options can be selected.\nCompared to other simulators of the genre, especially compared to commercial games, OpenBVE has its main focus on realism, not necessarily on user-friendliness. You should be willing to study operational manuals for the routes and trains you want to drive, and will in many cases not get along by just memorizing a few keystrokes. If you can identify with this focus, OpenBVE might be the right simulator for you.","name":"openBVE","packageUrl":"https://openbve-project.net/","publisher":"The OpenBVE Project","publisherUrl":"https://openbve-project.net/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/leezer3/OpenBVE/releases/tag/1.14.1.2","tags":["game","gaming","metro","railway","simulate","simulation","simulator","subway","train","underground"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"免许可证、开源、免费的火车驾驶模拟器。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"OpenBVE 是一款免许可证、开源、免费的火车驾驶模拟器。\n该程序包括制动系统、摩擦、空气阻力、倾覆等每辆车的详细模拟。在三维驾驶室中，加速、制动和转弯时模拟车身的晃动会增强驾驶体验。除此以外，OpenBVE 还配备了 3D 定位声音系统，可通过搭配环绕扬声器、列车外部和当前运行时刻表以体验最佳效果。最后，可以在主菜单轻松选择路线和列车以开始新的会话，可以将键盘或操纵杆设备配置为控制器，同时还有各种选项可选。\n与其它同类模拟器，尤其是与商业游戏相比，OpenBVE 的重点在于逼真性而不一定是用户友好性。你可能需要研究你所驾驶的路线和列车的操作手册，并且在大多数情况下仅靠记住几个按键是无法完成任务的。如果你能认同这一重点，OpenBVE 可能就是适合你的模拟器。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/leezer3/OpenBVE/releases/tag/1.14.1.2","tags":["列车","地铁","模拟","模拟器","游戏","火车","轨道交通","铁路"]}},"longDescription":"OpenBVE is a license-free, open source, free of charge train driving simulator.\nThis program includes detailed per-car simulation of the brake systems, friction, air resistance, toppling and more. In 3D cabs, the driving experience is augmented with forces that shake your simulated body upon acceleration and braking, as well as in curves. Besides that, OpenBVE features a 3D positional sound system best enjoyed with surround speakers, train exteriors and timetables for the current run. Finally, via the main menu, routes and trains be easily selected to start a new session, the controls can be configured to keyboard or joystick devices, and a variety of options can be selected.\nCompared to other simulators of the genre, especially compared to commercial games, OpenBVE has its main focus on realism, not necessarily on user-friendliness. You should be willing to study operational manuals for the routes and trains you want to drive, and will in many cases not get along by just memorizing a few keystrokes. If you can identify with this focus, OpenBVE might be the right simulator for you.","name":"openBVE","packageUrl":"https://openbve-project.net/","publisher":"The OpenBVE Project","publisherUrl":"https://openbve-project.net/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/leezer3/OpenBVE/releases/tag/1.14.1.2","tags":["game","gaming","metro","railway","simulate","simulation","simulator","subway","train","underground"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.14.1.2/app.json","detailSha256":"4dd4c47a879e5e44aef32d362cad11810bb9485539466b3e90d5498c93726512","releaseDate":"2026-10-07","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.14.1.2"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.14.1.1/app.json","detailSha256":"027a31eadf424fa9dda32dd6ef7f1dd02783aa78d89838f12ac4974079f9c76f","releaseDate":"2026-10-07","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.14.1.1"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.14.0.3/app.json","detailSha256":"a8cf4bc9d003429ea2ffee3bbadf7813e2444a40fbcc49c7b21c57ddc2a1d48d","releaseDate":"2026-08-10","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.14.0.3"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.14.0.2/app.json","detailSha256":"a0e5a0c82ae5034085fbb9f95a788b43d7e816420e340635bd73ab40b5443716","releaseDate":"2026-08-03","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.14.0.2"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.13.0.8/app.json","detailSha256":"17ee4debadd872215cd14d2f07ff6a3015267008b1213800fece3a073286b654","releaseDate":"2026-07-09","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.13.0.8"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.13.0.7/app.json","detailSha256":"224603296ae34b0cbcacb9196b67cb83cd9c7b7438566900b0b39991609486b9","releaseDate":"2026-07-06","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.13.0.7"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.13.0.5/app.json","detailSha256":"50acda6443a0110237dd25fa2a3f03dcbe390f93fa872b4ccfc9fbefbee88419","releaseDate":"2026-06-09","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.13.0.5"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.13.0.4/app.json","detailSha256":"2855b574de93e148ad2f28fc6dc4fcb0600a3bdd3610c8c7ecbf1f88f61f37db","releaseDate":"2026-06-08","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.13.0.4"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.13.0.2/app.json","detailSha256":"b9c84164b09af6